    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/5a6932952e182e93ac8f8e0d5946dfff.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=600 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/5a6932952e182e93ac8f8e0d5946dfff.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/5a6932952e182e93ac8f8e0d5946dfff.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>THEANTHRIA</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a furry dating simulator in progress in which you are the only human in existence! Humans in this world are seen as divine, almost mythical\u00a0 creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your human-tier dexterity and intelligence make you a perfect fit for a DyNein Delivery Pilot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the girls in town, get to know them, give them presents and have fun with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to buy presents to give, or furniture to decorate your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you equip your handy, company-provided Jump Pack, you will be open to new deliveries!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/d5ffb23505461118ca143c3c31773cb5.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/d5ffb23505461118ca143c3c31773cb5.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/d5ffb23505461118ca143c3c31773cb5.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you make those deliveries, the more money you will earn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall run, double jump, climb, and parkour your way around to make your deliveries as timely as possible to maximize profit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/e17d87e84e063d556bc9d4725f7bb7f6.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/e17d87e84e063d556bc9d4725f7bb7f6.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/e17d87e84e063d556bc9d4725f7bb7f6.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cute anthro gf!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/ee10f7395870eca8707aa9f9f080ebba.avif?t=1750970690\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span><br>Customize yourself, the human!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/127d322cf9f0ac0ef602a5e63a7dd820.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/127d322cf9f0ac0ef602a5e63a7dd820.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/127d322cf9f0ac0ef602a5e63a7dd820.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/0293178d07a61a77fda1d4db3b4fb3d3.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/0293178d07a61a77fda1d4db3b4fb3d3.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/0293178d07a61a77fda1d4db3b4fb3d3.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/524006d32f4d972d720ece13a43fb8a6.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/524006d32f4d972d720ece13a43fb8a6.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/524006d32f4d972d720ece13a43fb8a6.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/da46b4295388e1ae31ef399a88a0db0f.avif?t=1750970690\" data-has-big width=800 height=640 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/5a6932952e182e93ac8f8e0d5946dfff.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=600 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/5a6932952e182e93ac8f8e0d5946dfff.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/5a6932952e182e93ac8f8e0d5946dfff.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>THEANTHRIA</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a furry dating simulator in progress in which you are the only human in existence! Humans in this world are seen as divine, almost mythical\u00a0 creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your human-tier dexterity and intelligence make you a perfect fit for a DyNein Delivery Pilot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the girls in town, get to know them, give them presents and have fun with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to buy presents to give, or furniture to decorate your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you equip your handy, company-provided Jump Pack, you will be open to new deliveries!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/d5ffb23505461118ca143c3c31773cb5.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/d5ffb23505461118ca143c3c31773cb5.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/d5ffb23505461118ca143c3c31773cb5.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you make those deliveries, the more money you will earn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall run, double jump, climb, and parkour your way around to make your deliveries as timely as possible to maximize profit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/e17d87e84e063d556bc9d4725f7bb7f6.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/e17d87e84e063d556bc9d4725f7bb7f6.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/e17d87e84e063d556bc9d4725f7bb7f6.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cute anthro gf!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/ee10f7395870eca8707aa9f9f080ebba.avif?t=1750970690\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span><br>Customize yourself, the human!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/127d322cf9f0ac0ef602a5e63a7dd820.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/127d322cf9f0ac0ef602a5e63a7dd820.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/127d322cf9f0ac0ef602a5e63a7dd820.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/0293178d07a61a77fda1d4db3b4fb3d3.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/0293178d07a61a77fda1d4db3b4fb3d3.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/0293178d07a61a77fda1d4db3b4fb3d3.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/524006d32f4d972d720ece13a43fb8a6.poster.avif?t=1750970690\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/524006d32f4d972d720ece13a43fb8a6.webm?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/524006d32f4d972d720ece13a43fb8a6.mp4?t=1750970690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/da46b4295388e1ae31ef399a88a0db0f.avif?t=1750970690\" data-has-big width=800 height=640 /></span></p>",
